{
  "name": "winapi-rs",
  "description": "winapi-rs is a comprehensive collection of hand-curated Rust FFI bindings for the Windows SDK, providing essential types, constants, and function signatures. The repository follows a modular design, separating the core definitions crate from specific system library crates such as kernel32-sys, user32-sys, and advapi32-sys. It aims to unify low-level Windows systems programming in Rust by offering a single, authoritative source for Win32 and COM interface definitions.",
